---
// Visual Workflow Automation & Smart Auto-Responder Component
---

<section id="automation" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#FAF9FF]/60 border-t border-slate-100 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 sm:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-100/70 border border-purple-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#635BFF] mb-4">
        <span>Smart Automation</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Put routine inquiries on autopilot. <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-[#635BFF]">Keep humans in control.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
        Set up powerful triggers, routing rules, and review capture in minutes with our visual builder. Zero coding required.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Visual Workflow Builder Showcase (3 Connected Steps) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto items-stretch relative">
      
      <!-- STEP 1: TRIGGER -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 p-7 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-purple-300 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Step 1 • Trigger</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E]">24/7 Active</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#100F12]">New Customer Inquiry</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
            Customer texts via WhatsApp, Instagram DM, or webchat asking about pricing or booking an appointment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/80 -mx-3 -mb-3 p-3.5 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#100F12]">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            <span>Detected: "Do you have slots for Saturday?"</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STEP 2: LOGIC & ACTION -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-purple-200/90 p-7 shadow-[0_14px_36px_rgba(99,91,255,0.06)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-purple-400 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#635BFF] bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Step 2 • Smart Action</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#635BFF] font-semibold">&lt; 15s latency</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#100F12]">Instant Smart Response</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
            NewRelay auto-replies with live booking calendar, captures customer email, and routes VIPs to priority agents.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-purple-100 bg-purple-50/50 -mx-3 -mb-3 p-3.5 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#635BFF]">
            <span>⚡ Link sent + Assigned to Dr. Elena</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STEP 3: OUTCOME & REVIEW CAPTURE -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 p-7 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] flex flex-col justify-between relative group hover:border-purple-300 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Step 3 • Growth</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-amber-600 font-semibold">Automatic</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#100F12]">5-Star Review Capture</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
            Following appointment completion, an automated friendly WhatsApp invite captures a verified Google review.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 bg-amber-50/50 -mx-3 -mb-3 p-3.5 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">
            <span>⭐ +1 Verified 5-Star Review on Google</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
